Package: lambdock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, guile-3.0
Description: GTK4 desktop dock extensible in Guile Scheme
 Lambdock is a lightweight desktop dock built with a C core, GTK4, and dynamic
 configuration powered by GNU Guile Scheme.  On Wayland it uses gtk4-layer-shell
 for edge anchoring and the foreign-toplevel protocol for window tracking; on
 X11 it docks itself and tracks windows through EWMH.